    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have <strong>15 minutes</strong> to reach the end of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705910/extras/dc6814bbee070c3a95d074aa12e711d9.poster.avif?t=1753177479\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705910/extras/dc6814bbee070c3a95d074aa12e711d9.webm?t=1753177479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705910/extras/dc6814bbee070c3a95d074aa12e711d9.mp4?t=1753177479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have <strong>no arms</strong> and <strong>no legs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705910/extras/7a22772c35e147ad6a5b7027ace70fb5.poster.avif?t=1753177479\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705910/extras/7a22772c35e147ad6a5b7027ace70fb5.webm?t=1753177479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705910/extras/7a22772c35e147ad6a5b7027ace70fb5.mp4?t=1753177479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Will you find the strength and motivation to overcome your <strong>failures</strong>?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705910/extras/706936a34a69b9aa3210f149bb5f9c7d.poster.avif?t=1753177479\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705910/extras/706936a34a69b9aa3210f149bb5f9c7d.webm?t=1753177479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705910/extras/706936a34a69b9aa3210f149bb5f9c7d.mp4?t=1753177479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, <strong>it's okay to fail</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I <strong>fail</strong> every day.</p>",
