ore_item_assets/steam/apps/2705910/extras/706936a34a69b9aa3210f149bb5f9c7d.webm?t=1753177479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705910/extras/706936a34a69b9aa3210f149bb5f9c7d.mp4?t=1753177479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, <strong>it's okay to fail</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I <strong>fail</strong> every day.</p>",
